datetimelike.py 的 take 实现，或运行 pd.date_range('2020-01-01', periods=3, freq='D')[::-1].sort_values().freq 观察是否为 None。；该改动之后没有其他调用方或包装层补回 freq——核实方式：搜索 sort_values 对 DatetimeIndex/TimedeltaIndex 的调用点及最终合并版本实现。；最终合并版本是否保留 freq 重建逻辑（例如仅在 key is not None 时委托 super()）——核实方式：对照该 PR 的合并结果或后续提交。\n建议：先核实 DatetimeIndexOpsMixin.take 是否保留 freq；若丢失，可在返回前用 _with_freq(self.freq) 恢复（注意降序语义），或保留原显式重建逻辑并加 freq 断言测试。\n\n3. pandas/core/sorting.py:213 lexsort_indexer 新增 key 参数的文档写 versionadded:: 1.0.0，但该参数由本次变更引入，whatsnew v1.1.0 及 DataFrame/Series/Index 各 sort_* 文档均标注 1.1.0，版本标注不一致。\n待核实前提：本次变更的目标发布版本为 1.1.0（据候选所述 whatsnew v1.1.0），可通过读取 doc/source/whatsnew/v1.1.0.rst 核实。；key 参数确由本次变更引入而非早于 1.0.0 存在，可通过该提交的 git blame/历史核实。；其余 sort_* 文档确标注 versionadded:: 1.1.0，可通过读取 pandas/core/frame.py、series.py、base.py 相关文档核实。\n建议：改为 .. versionadded:: 1.1.0，与 whatsnew v1.1.0 及其余 sort_* 文档保持一致。\n\n覆盖说明：本轮未运行测试；以上内容不是缺陷指控，前提确认后才构成缺陷。","evidence":"","trigger":"","impact":"","suggestion":"","verification_status":"second_pass_review_plausible","verification_reason":"有代码依据的疑点汇总；复核未发现反证，前提待人工确认。","trace_id":"77e5f8f784e3e164"}],"todos":[{"content":"扫描并解析代码变更","status":"completed","order":0},{"content":"执行单 Agent 代码审查","status":"completed","order":1},{"content":"核对代码证据、第二轮复核并去重审查发现","status":"completed","order":2}],"trace":[{"id":"f4210a42b2e3b755","kind":"input","status":"succeeded","tool":"task_create","input":"","output":"","at":"2026-09-26T20:41:40.838+08:00","started_at":"2026-09-26T20:41:40.779+08:00","ended_at":"2026-09-26T20:41:40.838+08:00","duration_ms":59,"phase":"task"},{"id":"29a1873c1611553f","kind":"input","status":"succeeded","tool":"task_claim","input":"","output":"","at":"2026-09-26T20:41:40.866+08:00","started_at":"2026-09-26T20:41:40.838+08:00","ended_at":"2026-09-26T20:41:40.866+08:00","duration_ms":27,"phase":"task"},{"id":"47740bd998cc60de","kind":"input","status":"succeeded","tool":"background_create","input":"","output":"","at":"2026-09-26T20:41:40.888+08:00","started_at":"2026-09-26T20:4